   "title": "IDEA-005 · Test your stock IQ: 5 questions",
   "original_idea": "[IDEA-005] Test your stock IQ: 5 questions\nCarousel · Education · 2027-02-17\n\nObjective:\nStock IQ Quiz · Light theme · Instagram\n\nHook (EN):\nTest your stock IQ.\n\nHook (AR):\nاختبر معلوماتك بالمخزون.\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\n5 questions. Answers on the last slide.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nOne question per slide with A/B/C answer chips; last slide shows the answer key. Light version: photo in a rounded panel on Paper.\n\nSlides (carousels):\n1. Test your stock IQ. — 5 questions. Answers on the last slide.\n2. Q1. What is dead stock? — A) Damaged items  B) Items that haven't sold for months\n3. Q2. A transfer on the road should count… — A) At the source  B) At the destination  C) As in transit\n4. Q3. What is a cycle count? — A) Counting everything once a year  B) Counting a small part of stock on a schedule\n5. Q4. Sea freight Shenzhen → Beirut takes about… — A) 2 weeks  B) 30 days\n6. Q5. What does ETA stand for? — A) Estimated Time of Arrival  B) Exact Transfer Amount\n7. Answers: 1B · 2C · 3B · 4B · 5A — How many did you get?\n\nImages:\nBG-57\n\nNotes:\nHigh saves/comments.\n\nCaption:\nFive questions every stock manager should get right. No googling.\nComment your score: 5/5 gets bragging rights.",
