   "original_idea": "[IDEA-085] 2027 resolutions for stock managers\nCarousel · Control · 2027-01-04\n\nObjective:\nNew Year · Light theme · Instagram + LinkedIn\n\nHook (EN):\n2027 resolutions for stock managers.\n\nHook (AR):\nقرارات 2027 لكل مدير مخزون.\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\nPick one. Keep it.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nCover SE-03; one resolution per slide with a check box. Light version: photo in a rounded panel on Paper.\n\nSlides (carousels):\n1. 2027 resolutions for stock managers.\n2. Stop guessing. Start seeing.\n3. Log every move the day it happens.\n4. One map, not five files.\n5. Fewer calls, more sales.\n6. Which one is yours?\n\nImages:\nSE-03 · BG-57\n\nCaption:\nNew year, new habits. Which resolution are you taking on?",
