   "title": "IDEA-086 · Ramadan rush: order early",
   "original_idea": "[IDEA-086] Ramadan rush: order early\nCarousel · Education · 2027-01-06\n\nObjective:\nRamadan · answers How · Dark theme · Instagram + LinkedIn\n\nHook (EN):\nRamadan rush? Order early.\n\nHook (AR):\nعجقة رمضان؟ اطلب بكّير.\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\nThe import maths most businesses forget.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nCover SE-04; a simple timeline on BG-58: today → sea ~30 days → customs → truck → shelf → Ramadan.\n\nSlides (carousels):\n1. Ramadan rush? Order early.\n2. Ramadan starts around 8 February.\n3. Sea freight from China takes about 30 days, plus customs.\n4. Then a truck to your warehouse.\n5. So Ramadan stock should ship in early January.\n6. Track every container until it lands.\n\nImages:\nSE-04 · BG-58\n\nNotes:\nConfirm the Ramadan start date.\n\nCaption:\nIf your Ramadan stock comes by sea, the deadline is closer than it looks.\nWhen do you place your Ramadan orders?",
